  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "annot-zoho-sign-2b-s2-20260724",
   "x": 70,
   "y": 1770,
   "width": 840,
   "height": 166,
   "text": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-24 (Zoho Sign served-app proxy, 2B-S2): integrations/zoho-sign.ts gains the\nsend/status/sign-url/document proxy + zohoSignRouter (sibling of adobe-sign.ts). integrations/\nmay NOT import apps/, so renderHtmlToPdf (apps/pdf.ts, new Buffer export) + getOwnerOrgId (users\nstore, same lambda as the legal portal seam) + config custody (findConfigForOwner + decrypt) +\ncredential persistence are ALL INJECTED via ZohoSignDeps, wired ONLY in server.ts (composition\nroot). That injection also keeps the module free of the mongodb import chain, so the hermetic\nproxy e2e drives the real backend under plain node. Zoho is the LIVE provider; Adobe stays\nfacade (notConnectedBackend). Owner creds are loaded + decrypted JIT and never reach the page;\nthe 2B-S1 token core mints the Zoho-oauthtoken. Webhook business logic lands 2B-S3.",
   "originalText": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-24 (Zoho Sign served-app proxy, 2B-S2): integrations/zoho-sign.ts gains the\nsend/status/sign-url/document proxy + zohoSignRouter (sibling of adobe-sign.ts). integrations/\nmay NOT import apps/, so renderHtmlToPdf (apps/pdf.ts, new Buffer export) + getOwnerOrgId (users\nstore, same lambda as the legal portal seam) + config custody (findConfigForOwner + decrypt) +\ncredential persistence are ALL INJECTED via ZohoSignDeps, wired ONLY in server.ts (composition\nroot). That injection also keeps the module free of the mongodb import chain, so the hermetic\nproxy e2e drives the real backend under plain node. Zoho is the LIVE provider; Adobe stays\nfacade (notConnectedBackend). Owner creds are loaded + decrypted JIT and never reach the page;\nthe 2B-S1 token core mints the Zoho-oauthtoken. Webhook business logic lands 2B-S3.",
   "rawText": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-24 (Zoho Sign served-app proxy, 2B-S2): integrations/zoho-sign.ts gains the\nsend/status/sign-url/document proxy + zohoSignRouter (sibling of adobe-sign.ts). integrations/\nmay NOT import apps/, so renderHtmlToPdf (apps/pdf.ts, new Buffer export) + getOwnerOrgId (users\nstore, same lambda as the legal portal seam) + config custody (findConfigForOwner + decrypt) +\ncredential persistence are ALL INJECTED via ZohoSignDeps, wired ONLY in server.ts (composition\nroot). That injection also keeps the module free of the mongodb import chain, so the hermetic\nproxy e2e drives the real backend under plain node. Zoho is the LIVE provider; Adobe stays\nfacade (notConnectedBackend). Owner creds are loaded + decrypted JIT and never reach the page;\nthe 2B-S1 token core mints the Zoho-oauthtoken. Webhook business logic lands 2B-S3.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#b45309",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
