  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "annot-docx-2c-s5-20260725",
   "x": 70,
   "y": 3000,
   "width": 900,
   "height": 157.5,
   "text": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-25 (Docx agent tools through seams, 2C-S5): agents/ gains the three ekoa-docx\ntools WITHOUT touching the chokepoint. dev shipped them as its own @anthropic-ai MCP server; only\napi/src/llm/ may import that (FIXED-3/8/13), so agents/sdk-tools.ts declares them as plain\nSdkToolSpecs (docx_read / docx_source_set / docx_apply_edits = DOCX_TOOLS in agents/tools.ts,\nBUILD row only) and llm/ mounts them on the ONE 'ekoa' in-process MCP server (mcp__ekoa__docx_*).\nNEW DocxToolSeams (agents/seams.ts) is the ONLY edge to the collaborators - apps/document-source.ts\n(tier 5, never a sibling import), services/docx-redline.ts projectDocx, integrations/docx-fetch.ts's\nfetcher over the workspace-credential seam - wired in server.ts alone; unwired = honest 'not wired'\ntool content. build.ts binds appId = artifactId, userName + allowedDirs = [projectDir] FROM THE RUN.",
   "originalText": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-25 (Docx agent tools through seams, 2C-S5): agents/ gains the three ekoa-docx\ntools WITHOUT touching the chokepoint. dev shipped them as its own @anthropic-ai MCP server; only\napi/src/llm/ may import that (FIXED-3/8/13), so agents/sdk-tools.ts declares them as plain\nSdkToolSpecs (docx_read / docx_source_set / docx_apply_edits = DOCX_TOOLS in agents/tools.ts,\nBUILD row only) and llm/ mounts them on the ONE 'ekoa' in-process MCP server (mcp__ekoa__docx_*).\nNEW DocxToolSeams (agents/seams.ts) is the ONLY edge to the collaborators - apps/document-source.ts\n(tier 5, never a sibling import), services/docx-redline.ts projectDocx, integrations/docx-fetch.ts's\nfetcher over the workspace-credential seam - wired in server.ts alone; unwired = honest 'not wired'\ntool content. build.ts binds appId = artifactId, userName + allowedDirs = [projectDir] FROM THE RUN.",
   "rawText": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-25 (Docx agent tools through seams, 2C-S5): agents/ gains the three ekoa-docx\ntools WITHOUT touching the chokepoint. dev shipped them as its own @anthropic-ai MCP server; only\napi/src/llm/ may import that (FIXED-3/8/13), so agents/sdk-tools.ts declares them as plain\nSdkToolSpecs (docx_read / docx_source_set / docx_apply_edits = DOCX_TOOLS in agents/tools.ts,\nBUILD row only) and llm/ mounts them on the ONE 'ekoa' in-process MCP server (mcp__ekoa__docx_*).\nNEW DocxToolSeams (agents/seams.ts) is the ONLY edge to the collaborators - apps/document-source.ts\n(tier 5, never a sibling import), services/docx-redline.ts projectDocx, integrations/docx-fetch.ts's\nfetcher over the workspace-credential seam - wired in server.ts alone; unwired = honest 'not wired'\ntool content. build.ts binds appId = artifactId, userName + allowedDirs = [projectDir] FROM THE RUN.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#b45309",
