   "type": "text",
   "id": "annot-memvault-e2-b764415f",
   "x": 70,
   "y": 5612.5,
   "width": 900,
   "height": 210,
   "text": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-30 (memvault, slice E2): api/src/memvault/ is a NEW ordinary domain module (tier of\nknowledge/'s family; imports data/ + config only, NO llm/ path) behind routes/memvault.ts, mounted by\nserver.ts at /api/v1/memvault. First consumer of E1's requireUserOrApiKey ('user-or-key'): JWT or\nekoa_gk_ gateway key admits; the key principal (keyId, xClient) rides res.locals into the per-call audit.\nThree files, three concerns: jail.ts is THE single path-resolution point (charset + realpath-containment\nof the deepest existing ancestor; symlink escape fails closed; a grep test pins it as the only node:path\nimporter in the module); store.ts does markdown-file CRUD through the jail (temp-then-rename writes,\nstock basic-memory YAML frontmatter: title/type/permalink/tags/created/modified); service.ts runs the\nfour ops (write/read/list/delete) with one activity row + one structured console line per call\n(verdict ok|denied|jail_violation|not_found). Contract: shared/src/memvault.ts. Root config:\nmemvaultConfig() in config.ts (EKOA_MEMVAULT_ROOT || <EKOA_DATA_DIR>/memvault). Search + export are E3\nseams over the same on-disk format.",
   "originalText": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-30 (memvault, slice E2): api/src/memvault/ is a NEW ordinary domain module (tier of\nknowledge/'s family; imports data/ + config only, NO llm/ path) behind routes/memvault.ts, mounted by\nserver.ts at /api/v1/memvault. First consumer of E1's requireUserOrApiKey ('user-or-key'): JWT or\nekoa_gk_ gateway key admits; the key principal (keyId, xClient) rides res.locals into the per-call audit.\nThree files, three concerns: jail.ts is THE single path-resolution point (charset + realpath-containment\nof the deepest existing ancestor; symlink escape fails closed; a grep test pins it as the only node:path\nimporter in the module); store.ts does markdown-file CRUD through the jail (temp-then-rename writes,\nstock basic-memory YAML frontmatter: title/type/permalink/tags/created/modified); service.ts runs the\nfour ops (write/read/list/delete) with one activity row + one structured console line per call\n(verdict ok|denied|jail_violation|not_found). Contract: shared/src/memvault.ts. Root config:\nmemvaultConfig() in config.ts (EKOA_MEMVAULT_ROOT || <EKOA_DATA_DIR>/memvault). Search + export are E3\nseams over the same on-disk format.",
   "rawText": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-30 (memvault, slice E2): api/src/memvault/ is a NEW ordinary domain module (tier of\nknowledge/'s family; imports data/ + config only, NO llm/ path) behind routes/memvault.ts, mounted by\nserver.ts at /api/v1/memvault. First consumer of E1's requireUserOrApiKey ('user-or-key'): JWT or\nekoa_gk_ gateway key admits; the key principal (keyId, xClient) rides res.locals into the per-call audit.\nThree files, three concerns: jail.ts is THE single path-resolution point (charset + realpath-containment\nof the deepest existing ancestor; symlink escape fails closed; a grep test pins it as the only node:path\nimporter in the module); store.ts does markdown-file CRUD through the jail (temp-then-rename writes,\nstock basic-memory YAML frontmatter: title/type/permalink/tags/created/modified); service.ts runs the\nfour ops (write/read/list/delete) with one activity row + one structured console line per call\n(verdict ok|denied|jail_violation|not_found). Contract: shared/src/memvault.ts. Root config:\nmemvaultConfig() in config.ts (EKOA_MEMVAULT_ROOT || <EKOA_DATA_DIR>/memvault). Search + export are E3\nseams over the same on-disk format.",
